+# Models
+
+- Prefixes: `fct_` for facts/events, `dim_` for entities, snake_case (full list: `docs/naming.md`).
+- One model per file; file name matches the model name.
+- Marts live in `models/marts`; never `select *` there.
+- SQL style: lowercase keywords, CTEs instead of nested subqueries, trailing commas allowed (no leading commas), all timestamps in UTC.
+- Every model needs `unique` and `not_null` tests on its primary key.
+- If a column comes from a PII source, tag it with `meta: {pii: true}` in the YAML.
